    "preamble": "Malti Devi vs Ut Of J&K & Ors on 13 December, 2024 Author: Rahul Bharti Bench: Rahul Bharti Serial No. 77 High Court Of Jammu & Kashmir And Ladakh At Jammu Case:- Hcp No. 150/2024 Cm No. 7160/2024 Malti Devi .....Appellant(s)/Petitioner(s) Through: Mr. Sanchit Verma, Advocate. Vs Ut of J&K & Ors. ..... Respondent(s) Through: Mrs. Monika Kohli, Sr. Aag. Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Rahul Bharti, Judge Order (13.12.2024)",
